# Harness-materialized skill catalog. A harness (Claude/Codex) drops its full skill
# set — mirrors of .agents/skills plus plugin skills (impeccable, agent-browser,
# validators, mission playbooks) — into the adapter dirs on load. Never committed;
# not repo content. Keep only the tracked ck-orchestration adapter in each.
/.claude/skills/*
/.codex/skills/*
/.gemini/skills/*
/.agents/skills/*
/.agents/bundles/*
/.codex/agents/*
/.codex/config.toml

